msgid "Data Dimension Disabler"
msgstr "Data Dimension Disabler"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "Unknown error"

msgid "The request failed"
msgstr "The request failed"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "Disable data dimension"
msgstr "Disable data dimension"

msgid "Disable the {{type}} \"{{name}}\" as a data dimension?"
msgstr "Disable the {{type}} \"{{name}}\" as a data dimension?"

msgid ""
"Favorites that use this dimension will stop working until it is re-enabled "
"in the Maintenance app. Analytics tables shrink at the next analytics run."
msgstr ""
"Favorites that use this dimension will stop working until it is re-enabled "
"in the Maintenance app. Analytics tables shrink at the next analytics run."

msgid "Disable"
msgstr "Disable"

msgid "About this tool"
msgstr "About this tool"

msgid ""
"Categories, organisation unit group sets, data element group sets and "
"category option group sets can be enabled as data dimensions. Enabled "
"dimensions appear in the analytics apps, where they can be used to "
"disaggregate data. Each enabled dimension adds a column to the analytics "
"tables, which costs time during analytics generation and disk space."
msgstr ""
"Categories, organisation unit group sets, data element group sets and "
"category option group sets can be enabled as data dimensions. Enabled "
"dimensions appear in the analytics apps, where they can be used to "
"disaggregate data. Each enabled dimension adds a column to the analytics "
"tables, which costs time during analytics generation and disk space."

msgid ""
"The table ranks every enabled dimension by how often favorites "
"(visualizations, maps, event visualizations) that use it were opened in the "
"last 12 months. \"% of dimension views\" is the share of all such views; "
"\"% of favorite views\" compares against all favorite views, including "
"favorites that use no dimension."
msgstr ""
"The table ranks every enabled dimension by how often favorites "
"(visualizations, maps, event visualizations) that use it were opened in the "
"last 12 months. \"% of dimension views\" is the share of all such views; "
"\"% of favorite views\" compares against all favorite views, including "
"favorites that use no dimension."

msgid ""
"Dimensions with no or very few views are candidates for disabling. "
"Favorites that use a disabled dimension stop working, and section forms "
"lose their subtotals for it, so check before disabling. A dimension can be "
"re-enabled at any time in the Maintenance app. Try changes on a test system "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Dimensions with no or very few views are candidates for disabling. "
"Favorites that use a disabled dimension stop working, and section forms "
"lose their subtotals for it, so check before disabling. A dimension can be "
"re-enabled at any time in the Maintenance app. Try changes on a test system "
"first."

msgid "Remove the SQL view"
msgstr "Remove the SQL view"

msgid ""
"This deletes the SQL view \"{{name}}\" that the app installed. The app will "
"offer to recreate it the next time it is opened."
msgstr ""
"This deletes the SQL view \"{{name}}\" that the app installed. The app will "
"offer to recreate it the next time it is opened."

msgid "Remove SQL view"
msgstr "Remove SQL view"

msgid ""
"Your user needs the \"Add/Update SQL view\" authority (or the Superuser "
"role) to install the view."
