msgstr "SQL view not installed"

msgid ""
"The tool needs an SQL view named \"{{name}}\" to count how often favorites "
"use each dimension. Creating it requires the \"Add/Update SQL view\" "
"authority. The view is public read-only and can be removed from this app at "
"any time."
msgstr ""
"The tool needs an SQL view named \"{{name}}\" to count how often favorites "
"use each dimension. Creating it requires the \"Add/Update SQL view\" "
"authority. The view is public read-only and can be removed from this app at "
"any time."

